# Per-host run books and decision logs grow by appending a section keyed by
# PR number, so two branches touching the same file almost always both add
# at the end. `union` keeps both sides instead of conflicting. It also
# combines, silently, two edits to the same existing section, so read the
# merged file when both sides changed one; new sections are always safe.
hosts/*/DECISIONS.md merge=union
hosts/*/MANUAL-STEPS.md merge=union
